OL,3,GNEWSATributes to 'true lady'
OL,4,Ahairdresser killed in crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA retired hairdresser who died in
OL,7,Fhospital after a car crash has been
OL,8,Fdescribed as a "true lady" in a tribute
OL,9,Ffrom her family.
OL,11,FGillian Dixon, 76, was a passenger in a
OL,12,FFiat Punto involved in a crash with a
OL,13,Fdark-coloured Toyota Land Cruiser on
OL,14,Fthe A3057 near Goodworth Clatford,
OL,15,FHampshire, shortly after 17:45 BST on
OL,16,F29 August.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,337,330,200,160,0,100
PN,33602
SC,0002
CT,3,C
