OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F336A1788944261
OL,1,W5j 5Qws js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSATributes to 'true lady'
OL,4,Ahairdresser killed in crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FHer family, who said she was known as
OL,7,FGilly and lived in Houghton, described
OL,8,Fher as "the kindest, most caring and
OL,9,Fgentle person" who "put everyone before
OL,10,Fherself and worried about everyone,
OL,11,Feven those she barely knew".
OL,13,FThe Fiat driver, an 80-year-old man,
OL,14,Fwas taken to hospital with
OL,15,Flife-threatening injuries. Hampshire
OL,16,FPolice said he remained in a stable
OL,17,Fcondition.
